{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54727","headline":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月生晕，晕有珥兼生。\n将有火（京本作「大」）灾难闪避，三朝有雨得安宁，无雨祸还（京本作「须」）成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}